176
00:15:21.021 --> 00:15:24.358
I got something special
for you, boy, oh, boy.

177
00:15:25.225 --> 00:15:27.529
It ain't gonna be
all roses... Fuck.

178
00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:29.764
It's okay.
We'll go again.

