And comes all the way back
over to the side.

221
00:18:13.293 --> 00:18:15.162
Kevin getting up
on the top rope.

222
00:18:15.964 --> 00:18:16.931
Brody dazed now.

223
00:18:18.365 --> 00:18:22.537
